## Shared snippet dm-yaml.vm (shared/vm), inlined by tools/build-widget.py at "## BW_SHARED dm-yaml.vm".
## YAML subset parser in Velocity 1.4 (docs/DATA_MODEL_FORMAT.md 2, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md 3.3). Prototype verified on 2512
## (dmSpike run 1: the stored model parsed with 0 problems in about 4 ms).
## Input: $dmLines (text lines), $dmProbs. Lines before the first top-level key (version, name, model, uses, bindings,
## description) are skipped. Keys: letters, digits, _ and - only.
## Output, by path ("model.roles.SystemSpec.items[0].type"; root = ""):
##   $dmKind  path -> "map" | "list" | "scalar" | "null" (key without value)
##   $dmVal   path -> scalar text (unquoted)
##   $dmKeys  path of a map -> keys in source order
##   $dmCnt   path of a list -> number of entries
##   $dmLine  path -> line number (1-based, in $dmLines)
## Problems are added to $dmProbs as [severity, line, message]; the parser never stops the page.
## The parser is the macro dmParse (called at the end of this snippet for the model item, and by dm-model.vm for the model
## of a uses: reference); each call starts new maps.
#set($dmKeyRe = "[A-Za-z0-9_-]+:( .*)?")

